:'''Cerydra:''' All that needs to be said has been said.
:'''Cerydra:''' Dux Fragoris! Dux Brumalis! Escort the traitors to the prison!
:'''Cerydra:''' Before the next {{Rubi|Entry Hour|dawn}}, I will give them an end befitting of their betrayal...
:'''Lygus:''' O Great Imperator, your ambition certainly eclipses all things.
:'''Cerydra:''' You're still here, Theoros?
:'''Lygus:''' Of course. As the Theoros, I simply cannot miss this moment: miss witnessing the fall of a nameless one.
:'''Lygus:''' Or perhaps, I am waiting for you to give me an answer. Why would someone as powerful as you...
:'''Lygus:''' ...Use such a clumsy excuse as "imprisonment" to ensure the Deliverer's safety?
:'''Cerydra:''' Hah. So you've finally tossed aside your act.
:'''Lygus:''' I must point out that you are just as impressive an actor. This banquet was always going to be a game of chess...
:'''Lygus:''' Where you would try to control both sides and turn both them and me into your pawns.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Was all of this just a performance?
