:'''"Dux Helkolithist" Apollonius:''' What a difficult situation... No matter how we position our forces, this battle against Phagousa... will result in many casualties.
:'''"Dux Fragoris" Labienus:''' That's not something you or I should consider. The Imperator has already placed the chess pieces. We just need to fight for her until our last breath.
:'''Lygus:''' How astonishing. The commanders under you have such different personalities, yet they share the same loyalty...
